        "footer": {
          "text": "[Reserachers wanted to study more about Volcanos,they only know little about what's going on inside it.\nThey created Bots and Ships want were immune to heat,some had guns,some move fast.\nEach had a camera and a person controlling the Bot/Ship,\"Mission is a success\" they thought.\nThe system was corrupted by a virus called \"B21\",it was known to be one of the most lethal viruses in the world.\nMany Bots/Ships were corrupted and attacked the remining ones that were not corrupted.\nDr.Handerson Invented a Machine called Core and was going inside the volcano to help the ones that were not corrupted.\nThe Core can hold infinite ores and had it's two stone drills for starters.\n\nAnd that's where your story starts,Play now and see how long you survived survive The Lava Zone.]"
        },
